  "adapters": "Original procedural ground/tile/prop/companion drawers and original player/NPC sheet extraction execute against an offline Canvas implementation. No source React, identity, provider, Firebase, relay or learner data executes. Time-varying decoration uses a fixed art seed. Ground and solid tiles are baked; props remain separate depth-sorted sprites. Ambient motion and secondary decoration are not yet exported. Pixel quick-action RGB passes through the source Three linear-to-sRGB framebuffer conversion. Help uses the original react-icons SVG, rasterized with Sharp; its currentColor is resolved explicitly."
